{
  "file": "module1",
  "page": 43,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.5537719726562,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "further noted that individuals receiving treatment, clinicians providing treatment and programme",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        306.290283203125,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "managers would prefer shorter to longer regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        105.45719909667969,
        220.87937927246094,
        123.7271957397461
      ],
      "text": "Drug–drug interactions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        130.43324279785156,
        527.4420166015625,
        144.87623596191406
      ],
      "text": "Rifamycins induce certain cytochrome P-450 enzymes and may therefore interfere with medicines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.63319396972656,
        527.394775390625,
        158.07618713378906
      ],
      "text": "that depend on this metabolic pathway by accelerating their elimination. These medicines include",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        156.83314514160156,
        527.565673828125,
        171.27613830566406
      ],
      "text": "ART and many other medicines, such as anticonvulsants, antiarrhythmics, quinine, oral anticoagulants,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970861434936523,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.03309631347656,
        527.403564453125,
        184.47608947753906
      ],
      "text": "antifungals, oral and injectable contraceptives, corticosteroids, cyclosporine, fluoroquinolones and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        183.2331085205078,
        527.30029296875,
        197.6761016845703
      ],
      "text": "other antimicrobials, oral hypoglycaemic agents, methadone and tricyclic antidepressants. These",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        196.43324279785156,
        527.18701171875,
        210.87623596191406
      ],
      "text": "medicines might therefore have to be avoided when taking rifampicin- or rifapentine-containing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        209.63319396972656,
        283.2648010253906,
        224.0762481689453
      ],
      "text": "adjusted. regimens or their dosages should be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        231.33705139160156,
        527.3885498046875,
        245.78004455566406
      ],
      "text": "TPT regimens containing rifampicin or rifapentine should be prescribed with caution to people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        244.5370635986328,
        527.4305419921875,
        258.9800720214844
      ],
      "text": "with HIV who are on certain ART because of potential drug–drug interactions. TPT regimens can",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        257.73712158203125,
        527.57958984375,
        272.1801452636719
      ],
      "text": "significantly decrease the concentrations of boosted protease inhibitors or nevirapine and should not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990045547485352,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        270.9371337890625,
        354.6254577636719,
        285.3801574707031
      ],
      "text": "be co-administered, including to HIV-exposed infants on TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        292.6409912109375,
        527.2485961914062,
        307.0840148925781
      ],
      "text": "The results of a phase 1/2 clinical trial of 3HP and dolutegravir in adults with HIV indicate good",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        305.84100341796875,
        527.3651123046875,
        320.2840270996094
      ],
      "text": "tolerance and viral load suppression, no adverse events higher than grade 3 related to 3HP, and do",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        317.7650146484375,
        527.4215698242188,
        333.4840393066406
      ],
      "text": "(102) not indicate that rifapentine reduced dolutegravir levels sufficiently to require dose adjustment  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.9649963378906,
        527.4288940429688,
        346.68402099609375
      ],
      "text": "(103–105) Recent work continues to support this position  . Preliminary evidence from the phase 1/2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        345.4410095214844,
        527.4309692382812,
        359.884033203125
      ],
      "text": "trial also supports an immediate start of TPT among ART-naive people starting a dolutegravir-based",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.6410217285156,
        527.408447265625,
        373.08404541015625
      ],
      "text": "regimen. When 3HP was administered to 50 people with HIV who were ART-naive and who were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.84100341796875,
        527.1148681640625,
        386.2840270996094
      ],
      "text": "started on dolutegravir-containing ART, high rates of viral suppression, comparable to those with 6H,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996048927307129,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.7650146484375,
        527.4130249023438,
        399.4840393066406
      ],
      "text": "(105) were achieved, and no difference in grade 3 or 4 adverse events was observed . Administration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.9649963378906,
        527.4262084960938,
        412.68402099609375
      ],
      "text": "(106) of rifapentine with raltegravir was also found to be safe and well tolerated  . The 3HP regimen can",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.976675033569336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.4410095214844,
        527.4614868164062,
        425.884033203125
      ],
      "text": "be administered to patients receiving efavirenz-based antiretroviral regimens without dose adjustment,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.952848434448242,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.364990234375,
        286.39007568359375,
        439.0840148925781
      ],
      "text": "(107) according to a study of pharmacokinetics  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        446.3450012207031,
        527.1953735351562,
        460.78802490234375
      ],
      "text": "No dose adjustment is required when rifampicin is co-administered with efavirenz, and the two drugs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988243103027344,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.5448913574219,
        527.43212890625,
        473.9879150390625
      ],
      "text": "can be used together safely. When given with rifampicin, however, the dose of dolutegravir has to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.468994140625,
        527.4290771484375,
        487.1880187988281
      ],
      "text": "(108) be increased to 50 mg twice daily  , a dose that is usually well tolerated and shows equivalent",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        485.9449157714844,
        402.6471252441406,
        500.387939453125
      ],
      "text": "efficacy as efavirenz in viral suppression and recovery of CD4 cell count.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.64892578125,
        379.756103515625,
        522.0919189453125
      ],
      "text": "Concurrent use of alcohol should be avoided with all TPT regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        532.5155029296875,
        139.4984893798828,
        550.7854614257812
      ],
      "text": "Pregnancy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        557.4913940429688,
        527.420654296875,
        571.9343872070312
      ],
      "text": "In preparation for the 2020 update of the guidelines, a systematic review was conducted in 2019",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        570.69140625,
        527.3934936523438,
        585.1343994140625
      ],
      "text": "to assess evidence in support of or against the results of one RCT that showed adverse pregnancy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        582.6154174804688,
        527.5029296875,
        598.3344116210938
      ],
      "text": "(109,110) outcomes associated with use of IPT  . Further, three non-randomized, comparative",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        597.0914306640625,
        527.4122924804688,
        611.534423828125
      ],
      "text": "observational studies provided data on at least one of the pregnancy outcomes in women with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        609.015380859375,
        177.78347778320312,
        624.734375
      ],
      "text": "(111–113)  (see PICO 9 in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.965947151184082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.27000427246094,
        610.2913818359375,
        213.81021118164062,
        624.734375
      ],
      "text": "Annex 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965947151184082,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        213.74960327148438,
        610.2913818359375,
        527.446533203125,
        624.734375
      ],
      "text": "). While the RCT showed a higher risk of adverse pregnancy outcomes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965947151184082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        623.4913940429688,
        527.1792602539062,
        637.9343872070312
      ],
      "text": "in women who initiated IPT during pregnancy (Mantel-Haenszel OR stratified by gestational age, 1.51",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98143482208252,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        636.69140625,
        527.1256713867188,
        651.1343994140625
      ],
      "text": "95% CI 1.09 ; 2.10), all three of the other studies reported an overall OR < 1, suggesting the opposite",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995999336242676,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.6154174804688,
        527.4317626953125,
        664.3344116210938
      ],
      "text": "P (I =80%,  =0.002). A meta-analysis of two observational studies that reported adjusted estimates  2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.0914306640625,
        527.3881225585938,
        677.534423828125
      ],
      "text": "and the data of which could be pooled suggested a lower risk for composite adverse pregnancy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.015380859375,
        527.4089965820312,
        690.734375
      ],
      "text": "(111,112) outcomes (OR 0.40, 95% CI 0.20 ; 0.74) . The observational studies did not reproduce the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.4913940429688,
        527.3836669921875,
        703.9343872070312
      ],
      "text": "associations with IPT reported in the RCT for individual adverse outcomes, such as fetal or neonatal",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        702.69140625,
        527.528564453125,
        717.1343994140625
      ],
      "text": "death, prematurity, low birth weight and congenital anomaly. No statistically significant risks for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        715.8914184570312,
        527.399658203125,
        730.3344116210938
      ],
      "text": "maternal hepatotoxicity, grade 3 or 4 events or death were reported in any of the four studies. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        729.0914306640625,
        527.428955078125,
        743.534423828125
      ],
      "text": "GDG therefore concluded that there were insufficient grounds to change previous guidance or to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        742.2913818359375,
        524.5164794921875,
        756.734375
      ],
      "text": "develop a separate recommendation for use of IPT in pregnant women with HIV, and no evidence-to-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977176666259766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        755.4913940429688,
        278.86517333984375,
        769.9343872070312
      ],
      "text": "decision table was developed for this PICO in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        278.564208984375,
        755.4913940429688,
        315.8256530761719,
        769.9343872070312
      ],
      "text": "Annex 4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        315.82720947265625,
        755.4913940429688,
        527.4298095703125,
        769.9343872070312
      ],
      "text": ". The GDG considered that systematic deferral",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        454.0071105957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0402221679688,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "1. Recommendations 25",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}